 "strings": {
  "I'm Tsukumo. Yagami-shi's friend.": "",
  "Th-That's not who I...": "",
  "Perfect timing, Tsukumo! Make yourself at home.": "",
  "This kind, pretty lady is footing the bill on drinks for you and I tonight!": "",
  "Hey, you mind telling me what's going on here!?": "",
  "Sure. I thought it was suspicious how you left your seat all of a sudden and blatantly gave me an opening.": "",
  "Factoring that in, I figured you'd made a deal with some of our mutual acquaintances, like Kaito-san and Genda-sensei.": "",
  "So I had to dig into my deeper circles. You know I've got connections all over town, don't you?": "",
  "...Not bad, Tak. Not bad at all.": "",
  "Oh that note, where is that friend of mine...": "",
  "We can all drink together once she arrives. Your treat.": "",
  "Ahhh...! It wasn't supposed to go down like this...": "",
  "(Can't believe I actually pulled it off...)": "",
  "(But damn, Mari is no joke either.)": "",
  "(It doesn't seem like reading his body language will get me very far.)": "",
  "(Maybe it's less about him and more about his choice of drink.)": "",
  "(Maybe he's got a high tolerance for alcohol. But there's no way to tell just from looking at his face...)": "",
  "(All right, I think I gathered enough info to make a guess.)": "",
  "Then let the betting begin! So, how many drinks before he bursts?": "",
  "<color=yellow>Blue Mountain</color>, esteemed as \"The King of Coffee Beans,\" is one of our most popular coffees, and a standard of our menu.": "",
  "<color=yellow>Jamaican</color> coffee is known worldwide for its deep, bitter flavor that also boasts a wonderful splash of sweetness...": "",
  "<color=yellow>Mocha</color> is distinct for its rich, bitter flavor that lingers on the tongue. It also bears a bold, fruity sort of acidity.": "",
  "<color=yellow>Blended Coffee</color> is what we're famous for at Café Alps. We generally serve this fine roast as part of our breakfast set...": "",
  "<color=yellow>Kona</color> is a famous type of coffee that hails from Hawaii. It's known for its strong acidity and refreshing taste...": "",
  "<color=yellow>Toraja</color> coffee boasts a powerful bitter flavor and an unparalleled, full-bodied taste.": "",
  "<color=yellow>Guatemalan</color> coffee features a fruity, acidic flavor which is balanced well by its bitterness...": "",
  "<color=yellow>Java Robusta</color> is low on acidity and is recognized for its rich scent, similar to burnt wheat.": "",
  "(Mm, that's smooth. It's both sour and bitter, and has a nice scent. If I was feeling blue, this would pick me right up.)": "",
  "(Hmm. This one's quite bitter, yet also somewhat sweet. Oh, and it's got quite an aftertaste... almost earthy.)": "",
  "(It's very acidic, that's for sure. Also bitter, but rich and velvety as well. The flavor really lingers on the tongue...)": "",
  "(Ah! What a sharp, bitter taste... Wow, that woke me up. That was actually very refreshing.)": "",
  "(It's strikingly acidic... sour, even. Not bitter. Heck, it's almost sugary. Now <font_kind=yakuza_italic>that's</font_kind> a sweet aloha!)": "",
  "(Now this is what I call bitter. Full-bodied, too. I think it had some kind of exotic name... Makatora, or something?)": "",
  "(Ooh, this coffee's got 'em all in here! It's bitter, acidic, and even kind of fruity. Yet they all harmonize together.)": "",
  "(Such a robust cup of java... I can almost smell the warm fragrance of burnt wheat with each sip.)": "",
  "The one you drank was <color=yellow>Blue Mountain</color>.": "",
  "The one you drank was <color=yellow>Jamaican</color>.": "",
  "The one you drank was <color=yellow>Mocha</color>.": "",
  "The one you drank was <color=yellow>Blended Coffee</color>.": "",
  "The one you drank was <color=yellow>Kona</color>.": "",
  "The one you drank was <color=yellow>Toraja</color>.": "",
  "The one you drank was <color=yellow>Guatemalan</color>.": "",
  "The one you drank was <color=yellow>Java Robusta</color>.": "",
  "It boasts a refined scent, smooth texture, and a nice balance of sour and bitter.": "",
  "However, its definitive characteristic is its sharp, powerful aroma. It also possesses an earthy, refreshing aftertaste.": "",
  "Thanks to its elegant, mellow aroma, we sometimes call it \"Our Lady of Coffee.\"": "",
  "Its strong aroma and sharp, bitter flavor will give you a nice little wake-up call. That's why we serve it in the morning.": "",
  "And thanks to its relative lack of bitterness, it's quite easy to drink. It even gives off a light, sweet scent.": "",
  "In addition, it barely contains any acidity.": "",
  "Furthermore, it's accented by a sweet aroma, and contains the perfect amount of richness that makes it simply irresistible.": "",
  "Its central bitter flavor and profound sweetness give way to a mellow taste that isn't too rich or overbearing.": "",
  "I believe its smooth texture and complex flavors result in a coffee truly fit for a king!": "",
  "I believe its bittersweet flavor and earthy aftertaste make it stand out among the rest.": "",
  "I believe that people are drawn to its rich, bitter taste that goes well with chocolate or even a latte.": "",
  "I believe its complex blend of flavors and sharp bite are perfect for starting your day!": "",
  "I believe its sparkling burst of acidity and pleasant floral aroma give way to a hint of sweet goodness.": "",
  "I believe its bitter, full-bodied flavor stands out sharply due to its lack of acidity.": "",
  "I believe its fruity, acidic flavor belies a subtle hint of bitterness that balances its overall taste.": "",
  "I believe its irresistible bitter flavor is complemented by a sensation of crackled wheat beneath a sweet, sugary core.": "",
  "Thanks for coming out today, Yosuke-san. You've got a new job for me, right?": "",
  "You don't have to be so formal with me, Yagami-san. I'm younger than you anyway...": "",
  "Yeah? You got it. So tell me about this new pervert.": "",
  "He's one of the Twisted Trio. This one's name is... Ass Catchem.": "",
  "Ass... Catchem... Really.": "",
  "If only it were a laughing matter. This guy has ass on the mind, and he'll grope whatever he can grab.": "",
  "I guess he knows what he's about... And Tsukino-san was one of his victims?": "",
  "Yes. It was in broad daylight, just the other day.": "",
  "And you're sure it's the Twisted Trio again? What gave him away?": "",
  "It's what he said when I turned around in horror...": "",
  "\"That supple ass of yours would be perfect in a long distance race, baby.\"": "",
  "Ass Catchem's calling card is apparently telling his victims what sport they should play... based on their butts.": "",
  "That's... disturbing. Did he say anything else?": "",
  "Yeah. He told me I should cut my hair to lower my wind resistance.": "",
  "He really knows his sports, huh...": "",
  "The good news is that you saw his face this time. Can you describe him?": "",
  "Well, he had dark-rimmed glasses and weird stubble patches around his mouth. Oh, and his head was shaved clean.": "",
  "I've run into him twice at this point, so I have a pretty clear picture of the guy.": "",
  "Really? Twice!?": "",
  "Yup. Tsukino has the worst luck with perverts, apparently.": "",
  "And the cops have this description, right? Haven't they locked this guy down yet?": "",
  "I'm afraid not... Ass Catchem is fast. Really fast.": "",
  "Apparently he's a former track star himself, so he can outrun just about any pursuer.": "",
  "That certainly makes this complicated.": "",
  "(But if he's groped her twice, it couldn't just be a coincidence...)": "",
  " Yes, but you got the first guy, right!? And now my sweet, innocent sister's honor is at stake! He's the first guy to...": "",
  "Hey, is that really relevant!?": "",
  "Can we count on you again, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Sure, but my fee isn't exactly student friendly. You managed it once, but...": "",
  "It's okay! I've been putting in some OT lately!": "",
  "So, what's the plan to catch the guy this time?": "",
  "Well, once again, it's probably best to catch the guy in the act.": "",
  "(I can't exactly use Tsukino as bait though...)": "",
  "If only we had someone who could pretend to be your sister...": "",
  "Hm? Why are you looking at me like that, Yagami-san?": "",
  "(The two of them <font_kind=yakuza_italic>are</font_kind> twins...)": "",
  "You know you have an uncanny resemblance to your sister, right, Yosuke?": "",
  "Well, yeah. We're twins and all.": "",
  "In that case, how would you feel about posing as Tsukino? It would be the perfect bait.": "",
  "What!? Pretend to be her!?": "",
  "No way, man. He'd figure it out right away!": "",
  "You sure? I think we stand a pretty good chance.": "",
  "Don't you agree with him! No, no, and no!": "",
  "Well, that's a shame. I think that was probably our best bet at catching him.": "",
  "...Fine then.": "",
  "If Yosuke's too chicken to do it... I will.": "",
  "It's our best shot, right?": "",
  "Yes, but... Are you certain you'd want to put yourself at risk?": "",
  "I can do it. After all, you and Yosuke would be there to protect me, right?": "",
  "Just take him down before he gets his gross hands on me, okay?": "",
  "All right. If you're sure, I think we have a plan.": "",
  "Yeah! Don't worry, Tsukino! Ass Catchem is grass and we're the lawnmower!": "",
  "(I can't say I'm not worried about the risk here... But it's our best shot...)": "",
  "Hello? Yagami-san? Did you find the perv?": "",
  "And who dresses like that...": "",
  "Agh!": "",
  "You cut your hair short, just like I told you. Excellent. <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Excellent</font_kind>.": "",
  "W-Wait, I'm not—": "",
  "Hmm? What's this? You've been toning up your ass, haven't you.... Hehehe.": "",
  "Are you working your gluts?": "",
  "Eep! H-Help me, Yagami-san!": "",
  "(Not even Ass Catchem can tell those two apart...)": "",
  "Ready, set...": "",
  "Hey, get the hell back here!": "",
  "*pant* *pant* Shit, this guy is fast.": "",
  "Huff... Huff... Nobody's ever caught up to me before... Just who <font_kind=yakuza_italic>are</font_kind> you!?": "",
  "...The detective who's gonna bring you in. You're Ass Catchem, right?": "",
  "*pant* D-Detective? Does that mean... you're the one who took down the first of the trio?": "",
  "You mean the Panty Professor? ...It hardly matters. You're coming with me downtown.": "",
  "Hehehe. Oh, I wouldn't make any assumptions about bringing me down as easily as him...": "",
  "He was nothing. A nobody. He should've thanked his lucky stars we even let him <font_kind=yakuza_italic>in</font_kind> the Twisted Trio.": "",
  "You're saying a guy who used a remote-controlled drone to steal panties off balconies was \"nothing\"?": "",
  "Never mind him! Right now my blood's really pumping after grabbin' that cute girl's ass and a nice jog!": "",
  "My whole body feels rock hard!": "",
  "Great, but does that mean you had to strip?": "",
  "Now you'll feel the power that's inside Ass Catchem!": "",
  "Hehehe... Don't get cocky now. You haven't seen anything yet!": "",
  "When I get my hands on a hot girl's ass, nothing can stop me! Hahaha!": "",
  "Yeah, about that...": "",
  "Did you know the ass you grabbed back there actually belonged to that girl's twin brother?": "",
  "Wh-What!? That means...": "",
  "I got hard... off a guy?": "",
  "Better learn to like it. The only ass you'll catch in the slammer will be muscular and manly.": "",
  "M-Man butts!?": "",
  "Noooooo!": "",
  "Hey, stop struggling!": "",
  "Please, no! Man butts do nothing for meeeee!": "",
  "So, Ass Catchem's been brought to justice. I'd say this case is firmly in the rear view. Heh.": "",
  "You're incredible, Yagami-san! Not even the police could rope him in!": "",
  "I'd save your thanks for your brother, Tsukino.": "",
  "No, really! You're the real hero, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Nah. Work just goes in strange directions sometimes.": "",
  "I... I've been groped...": "",
  "You got what you deserved, I'd say.": "",
  "Ughhh...": "",
  "Here's your payment, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Oh, thanks.": "",
  "Well, goodbye!": "",
  "(There's only one of the Twisted Trio left standing...)": "",
  "(I hope Tsukino is free of them, though. No way she draws the ire of the next one... Right?)": "",
  "How's it looking, Yagami-san? Any sketchy perverts catch your eye?": "",
  "No, nothing yet. But don't let your guard down all the same.": "",
  "Hm. That guy... He matches the description...": "",
  "Yosuke! Look out! Behind you!": "",
  "I'm getting nothing but bad vibes here. I better get in touch with Yosuke.": "",
  "(Tsukino-san must be worried... I should probably hurry up and capture this pervert.)": "",
  "(He really does look like Tsukino. It would have been easier if he agreed to be the bait...)": "",
  "Hey... Aren't you the guy who was being chased by the cops not too long ago?": "",
  "...What? Oh, trust me, I wasn't doing anything bad.": "",
  "It was self-defense, see. I was getting harassed by some thugs, and...": "",
  "Who cares about that!? All I noticed was that your running was incredible!": "",
  "That's what you're focused on...? Just who are you, anyway?": "",
  "I'm Shun Isaka, a sprinter in track and field!": "",
  "All right, Yagami-san. There's a favor I need to ask a speed demon like you...": "",
  "Chase me, Yagami-san! I want you to run after me!": "",
  "Excuse me? What do you mean?": "",
  "Yes, I want to feel your footsteps right behind my heels! I can't unlock my full potential unless I'm being chased...": "",
  "Doesn't that mean you only have limited potential in the first place?": "",
  "Not at all! Ever since I was little, I'd always run like the wind whenever someone chased me!": "",
  "Okay... Even if that is the case, why not ask one of your fellow athletes?": "",
  "Those guys just don't understand the concept... That rush you feel when you know you're almost caught...": "",
  "Your running has a peculiar intensity, Yagami-san. Seeing those legs pound the pavement... It's what I've always yearned for!": "",
  "I bet if someone like you is barreling down behind me, I'll unlock a hidden potential within me!": "",
  "Please haul ass for me, Yagami-san! I'll give you something special if you do.": "",
  "Your choice of words is... horrible. But fine, I guess I'll chase you down.": "",
  "Yes! You're wonderful!": "",
  "So, how do we start this thing?": "",
  "Just chase after me! Let your predatory instinct run wild!": "",
  "I don't even... Let's just get this over with.": "",
  "Woo yeah! Then, on your mark, get set, gooooooooo!!!": "",
  "Yagami-san, you were... nothing short of amazing!": "",
  "*pant* Well? *gasp* Did you unlock any hidden potential?": "",
  "Yes! I feel like I grasped something important during our little jog. Here's your reward, as promised.": "",
  "Good. Then I'll be going now.": "",
  "Wait, wait! Um... I actually still have some more grasping to do.": "",
  "Yeah! I grasped something important during our run, but it wasn't a full grasp. So please help me again sometime!": "",
  "I guess I could... if I feel like it.": "",
  "Sounds like a plan!": "",
  "I'll be warming up right here, so please come talk to me whenever you're free, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san, are you feeling... up to the chase?": "",
  "Sorry, but now's not a good time for a jog. Maybe later.": "",
  "No problem! I'll still be here warming up.": "",
  "Sure. I might even run you over if you're not careful.": "",
  "That's the spirit! Then... on your mark, get set, goooooo!!!": "",
  "*pant* Well? *gasp* Did you get something out of it?": "",
  "This... sensation! The rush of adrenaline... A billion sneakers thundering down a million streets, echoing across the cosmos...!": "",
  "...I'm assuming you grasped your inner potential?": "",
  "You better believe I did! Basically, my problem is that I was trying to run too fast!": "",
  "Yeah. I realized I was putting way too much stress on speed and not enough on form, which resulted in an instability.": "",
  "But when you were chasing me, I was only focused on the thrill of almost being caught.": "",
  "This helped me block out any unnecessary thoughts... stabilize my form... and helped me maintain my top speed!": "",
  "That is kind of incredible. I don't really get it, but I'm glad you grasped your inner potential.": "",
  "Yes! It's all thanks to you, Yagami-san!": "",
  "To show my proper gratitude, I put in a little more than last time.": "",
  "Sweet.": "",
  "Oh, and please take this, too.": "",
  "It wasn't of much use to me, so I thought you'd get a kick out of it... Or I could just throw it away.": "",
  "You know what, I'll take it. Why not.": "",
  "(A book on combat techniques? That actually might come in handy.)": "",
  "Alrighty! Well, I better get ready for my next competition!": "",
  "Chase your dreams, Isaka-kun.": "",
  "Yep, and I'll be starting with Japan's national record! Catch you later, man!": "",
  "Um, Yagami-san. Have you seen Tsukino, by any chance?": "",
  "No, I haven't. Something wrong?": "",
  "I came out shopping with her, but we got seperated.": "",
  "Huh. That's concerning.": "",
  "Was that a scream!?": "",
  "That was Tsukino! I think it came from the back alley!": "",
  "Ewww...!": "",
  "Oh no. Another pervert!?": "",
  "What the hell did you do to Tsukino!?": "",
  "Peace, friends. I assure you, I'm just a perfectly innocuous gentleman.": "",
  "I simply wanted to introduce the young lady to my sweet, innocent son.": "",
  "What kind of gentlemen looks like you!?": "",
  "P-P-P-Put it away!": "",
  "Who are you!? A Twisted Trio copy cat!?": "",
  "How dare you put me in the same league as those debauchers, sir. ": "",
  "I am the Prince of Perverts, the Emperor of Exhibitionism...": "",
  "GIANT IMPACT!": "",
  "Giant... Impact!?": "",
  "I've heard of him, Yagami-san! He's the newest pervert to stain the streets of Kamurocho!": "",
  "Hoho, it seems my reputation precedes me.": "",
  "H-Hey! Wait!": "",
  "Tsukino!": "",
  "I-I'm okay. He just showed me his... genitals...": "",
  "That piece of shit! How dare he show my innocent sister his junk!?": "",
  "We should file a police report, you two.": "",
  "Any clue how that pervert found you, Tsukino-san?": "",
  "No idea. He came out of nowhere, and threw back his coat. He was naked underneath...": "",
  "So you saw it? The whole thing!?": "",
  "Y-Yeah. I tried not to look...": ""
